Licensed under the MIT License.

`internal/soc/mactop` is a vendored copy of mactop's collector layer
(IOReport power/thermal sampling, SMC readings, topology, GPU process
stats), pinned to upstream commit
220df7efeba860f50939b027afc03ee330f209bf. Every mactop collector lives
under that module's own `internal/app` package, which Go's internal-package
rule makes unreachable from outside `github.com/metaspartan/mactop` — this
is why the code is copied rather than imported. See
internal/soc/VENDOR.md for the exact file list, the edits made to each
file, and `make vendor-diff` for re-checking the copy against upstream.

